{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡流傳一段車Cam片段，顯示吐露港公路在雨天期間發生一宗交通意外。事發時正在下雨，一輛藍色私家車沿快線行駛期間，懷疑失控自炒撞向路邊石壆，期間激起巨大水花並於路中心「打白鴿轉」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-10h33m41s114.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026Jy8uHiw4PP1787712413.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-10h33m41s114.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片顯示，事發時現場正下着雨，路面相當濕滑，當時車Cam車輛正沿中線前行，未幾一輛藍色私家車從右側快線駛過，私家車行駛期間懷疑踩中快線積水，瞬間失控打滑並撞向右邊石壆，現場即時濺起高高的巨型水花，撞壆後私家車隨即在路中心旋轉「打白鴿轉」。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-10h33m44s206.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026sEqDqrUkTz1787712443.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-08-26-10h33m44s206.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段曝光後隨即引來大批網民圍觀，不少人直指畫面動魄驚心，紛紛留言驚呼：「嚇死人！」、「呢啲天氣要小心」、「呢種天氣最易跣胎。」、「成日有水氹」、「積水位真係好危險。」及「快線有時反而最多積水。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T03:20:20.726132+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":308,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}